// Issue 1 regression (FIXED by another session).
//
// The REAL bug was the SILENT wrong result: reassigning into an existing
// plain `str` variable from `os.arg(...)` (?str) used to compile fine and
// unpack only the payload, discarding the ok/nil/err tag. Out-of-range
// therefore produced an EMPTY STRING instead of an error.
//
// The [15w45dqk] error below is the CORRECT behaviour, not a regression.
// Do not "fix" it back to compiling silently.
x str = ''
i = 0
x = os.arg(i + 1)
